        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"c87707a0-3dff-492b-a4e4-81475e0159d3\",\"review_text\":\"Chutyapeyyyyy ka app hai bhnchood\"},{\"review_id\":\"de866f16-f326-4a90-a992-11024f1355e0\",\"review_text\":\"This app is soo good i like it very much\"},{\"review_id\":\"d452cf80-216d-4fa9-b829-d3b685e81b4e\",\"review_text\":\"Please I want to download my song\"},{\"review_id\":\"4debbbaf-74a1-43fa-87de-5e40bc35e643\",\"review_text\":\"5 minute ads between 2-3 songs is quite aggressive. Not a good experience at all.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ae9c5401-2759-49fb-94df-0fc35760689e\",\"review_text\":\"Great music listening app. 🫰🏽 Listening with friends is awesome. Jams, same device control, more artists every day. Y'all are getting better and better with it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9ca06aa1-edeb-4a66-b57c-e15c1c137429\",\"review_text\":\"Fanstic\"},{\"review_id\":\"d98dd040-04d3-427f-b6e0-309394e2da0c\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify is really good but there is too many ads and the lyrics arent loading please fix this problem\"},{\"review_id\":\"1dac4114-95bc-4029-9ab4-67ad2ed1be13\",\"review_text\":\"Edit7: The new \\\"Private\\\" option for playlists is a downgrade. And, it isn't just me having this opinion. A lot of users dislike having their playlists available to the public despite not shown on their page. It's a good button and if the team likes it then it should stay. BUT, you should re-add the \\\"Make Private\\\" option back. It's kinda making me not want to use spotify since the sole reason that I had intially installed the app was compile all the songs I know and not show it publicly. Like CDs\"},{\"review_id\":\"65b122b9-5487-4bdc-8ddc-e2e2ea252aa1\",\"review_text\":\"Good cum🥵\"},{\"review_id\":\"92fad1b8-1b3e-4e89-9401-a2b0ed5e76d6\",\"review_text\":\"I love it so much\"}]}"
